LineComment   "// The define-a-union-then-consume-it flow end to end: a member value flows into"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// the named union, and worth consumes it. The member value is tagged Coin as it"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// flows into GameValue, so worth's match dispatches confidently over the record"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// union and Total folds to the Coin's amount (7) at compile time."
Newline       "\n"
